OL,3,GNEWSAFamily welcome probe into police
OL,4,Acontact with killer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a woman stabbed to death
OL,7,Fin her home by a psychotic stranger
OL,8,Fhave welcomed a decision to hold an
OL,9,Finquest to look at why police allowed
OL,10,Fthe killer to walk free shortly before
OL,11,Fthe attack.
OL,13,FAngela Lloyd, 56, was killed in her
OL,14,FNewton Aycliffe home by Patricia
OL,15,FHewitt, 42, in August 2025.
OL,17,FHewitt, who earlier that day had been
OL,18,Fgiven a suspended sentence for randomly
OL,19,Fattacking a woman by magistrates, was
OL,20,Fsentenced to an indefinite hospital
OL,21,Fdetention order after admitting
OL,22,Fdiminished responsibility manslaughter.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
