OL,3,GNEWSAFamily welcome probe into police
OL,4,Acontact with killer
OL,5,
OL,6,FCounty Durham coroner Jeremy
OL,7,FChipperfield said there were
OL,8,F"important" issues raised by the family
OL,9,Fwhich warranted an inquest.
